  <p slot="note" class="mt-3 text-sm text-muted">
    Inline palettes work as always-open searchable lists. Active state is exposed through
    <code class="bg-code-bg px-1.5 py-0.5">data-selected</code> and
    <code class="bg-code-bg px-1.5 py-0.5">aria-selected</code>. Keyboard navigation is handled at the palette
    root, without forcing focus into the input on generic box clicks.
  </p>

  <Code slot="code-css" code={inlineCssCode} lang="html" theme="vitesse-light" />
  <Code slot="code-tailwind" code={inlineTailwindCode} lang="html" theme="vitesse-light" />
